WEBVTT

00:07.270 --> 00:10.570
<b>Spirits are the embodiment
of the rumors and legends they're based on.</b>

00:11.610 --> 00:16.070
<b>It seems as if you were taken over by
the personality created from Demon and Human lore.</b>

00:16.280 --> 00:20.950
<b>Taken over? Misa Ilioroagu is no more
than my temporary form.</b>

00:20.950 --> 00:23.620
<b>I am Avos Dilhevia.</b>

00:23.620 --> 00:26.210
<b>The one who will make Dilhade
the realm of the Royals,</b>

00:26.210 --> 00:28.630
<b>and rule this world as it should be ruled.</b>

00:29.000 --> 00:32.260
<b>Towards that end,
Demon King Anos Voldigoad...</b>

00:32.920 --> 00:37.010
<b>...you misfit, sham king...
I shall destroy you!</b>

02:07.770 --> 02:12.190
<b>05 - IN BETWEEN ROYALTY AND MIXED BLOOD</b>

02:07.980 --> 02:10.560
<b>While it was quite the profound puzzle...</b>

02:10.810 --> 02:13.020
<b>...now that I think of it,
the answer was simple enough.</b>

02:13.610 --> 02:15.440
<b>That battle of wits with Ziek.</b>

02:15.820 --> 02:20.610
<b>Its purpose was to steer me away
from finding out the identity of the Child of God.</b>

02:20.870 --> 02:25.370
<b>He had the right to lie, so I had
to figure out what he would lie about.</b>

02:25.370 --> 02:29.750
<b>Meaning that he was trying to conceal
the truth by not lying in the first place.</b>

02:31.830 --> 02:35.670
<b>As the Demon King of Tyranny, you possess
the Demonic Eyes of Destruction.</b>

02:37.720 --> 02:41.760
<b>Not only are you a purebred Demon,
you're also a half-spirit, half-demon.</b>

02:41.760 --> 02:42.720
<b>And...</b>

02:44.600 --> 02:46.770
<b>I know your name.</b>

02:47.180 --> 02:49.190
<b>During that battle,
I baited him.</b>

02:49.520 --> 02:54.020
<b>With the false memories that Ziek
had implanted in himself.</b>

02:54.480 --> 02:58.780
<b>He pounced on them,
and his actions proved my hunch right.</b>

02:59.360 --> 03:01.320
<b>And just before he took his own life,</b>

03:01.320 --> 03:04.660
<b>he actually did implant
those bogus memories in himself.</b>

03:05.330 --> 03:09.870
<b>And that would give the impression that all
of the answers in that battle of wits were false.</b>

03:09.870 --> 03:15.670
<b>I would never realize who the Child
of God was... or so you believed.</b>

03:16.130 --> 03:20.760
<b>Your true motive for attacking Meleheyth
was to postpone the magical broadcast.</b>

03:21.340 --> 03:24.140
<b>If word that Avos Dilhevia
was a fake were to spread...</b>

03:24.300 --> 03:26.310
<b>...you wouldn't be able to exist.</b>

03:27.470 --> 03:31.060
<b>Gerad and the Spirit King's goal
was to put Misa in danger,</b>

03:31.060 --> 03:35.730
<b>as well as to forcibly awaken her true form.
Am I right?</b>

03:35.730 --> 03:38.690
<b>You've figured it all out too late.</b>

03:38.690 --> 03:43.740
<b>By now, Demons all over Dilhade now believe
that I'm the Demon King of Tyranny.</b>

03:43.990 --> 03:46.620
<b>Too late? I don't think so.</b>

03:46.910 --> 03:48.990
<b>What you're after
is the Magic Sword of Destruction.</b>

03:49.330 --> 03:55.380
<b>The reason you haven't killed me yet
is because you need more time to get your hands on it.</b>

03:55.540 --> 03:57.670
<b>Why don't you shut up, you fool?</b>

04:01.170 --> 04:06.220
<b>How comical, Anos.
You've been stripped of everything.</b>

04:06.350 --> 04:08.930
<b>You've been reduced to a mere Demon.</b>

04:11.060 --> 04:13.060
<b>Don't get carried away, you fake.</b>

04:13.060 --> 04:17.400
<b>No matter what you take from me,
you can never take away who I am.</b>

04:17.650 --> 04:20.730
<b>Go on and wallow in your dreams of glory.</b>

04:20.730 --> 04:23.320
<b>Until the real Demon King returns, at least.</b>

04:27.910 --> 04:28.990
<b>A barrier.</b>

04:28.990 --> 04:30.160
<b>Apparently.</b>

04:30.490 --> 04:32.750
<b>We can't transfer directly.</b>

04:33.040 --> 04:35.830
<b>This is quite devastating,
this Magic Power.</b>

04:35.830 --> 04:36.880
<b>Lord Anos!</b>

04:38.340 --> 04:40.340
<b>That magical broadcast just now...</b>

04:40.340 --> 04:43.800
<b>Did Misa turn into the fake Demon King?</b>

04:43.800 --> 04:45.380
<b>It's not as if she turned into him.</b>

04:46.010 --> 04:47.890
<b>What this means is that from the start,</b>

04:47.890 --> 04:51.810
<b>half of Misa was created
from Avos Dilhevia's rumors and lore.</b>

04:54.810 --> 04:57.270
<b>I was the one... who spread that lore.</b>

04:58.310 --> 05:01.860
<b>Because I created
that false Demon King, she...</b>

05:04.280 --> 05:06.660
<b>This is no time to be dwelling on the past.</b>

05:07.160 --> 05:10.910
<b>We have to defeat Avos Dilhevia
sooner rather than later.</b>

05:10.910 --> 05:12.120
<b>You're right.</b>

05:12.910 --> 05:16.000
<b>The radical Royalists will likely follow her.</b>

05:16.330 --> 05:18.790
<b>As it stands now,
the hybrid Demons are in danger.</b>

05:19.130 --> 05:23.210
<b>But... half of Misa is Avos Dilhevia, right?</b>

05:24.420 --> 05:27.640
<b>If that part of her is gone,
Misa won't be able to survive.</b>

05:27.930 --> 05:29.640
<b>She'll get Spirit Disease.</b>

05:29.930 --> 05:34.850
<b>Not to worry. All we have to do is find
a way to save Misa and destroy only Avos.</b>

05:36.100 --> 05:39.860
<b>This isn't impossible enough
for me to throw in the towel.</b>

05:40.190 --> 05:43.610
<b>Right. 2,000 years ago,
all I did was give up.</b>

05:44.570 --> 05:46.490
<b>But this time,
I'm not giving up on anything.</b>

05:51.490 --> 05:54.200
<b>So you're not going
to let us out of here, Enyunien?</b>

05:54.200 --> 05:59.250
<b>Forgive me. I cannot allow you
to attack Lady Leno's child.</b>

05:59.580 --> 06:02.040
<b>This is the Extra Class Cocoon.</b>

06:02.040 --> 06:06.880
<b>Unless you take this class to the end,
you'll never get out of here.</b>

06:07.050 --> 06:11.430
<b>Not that I don't see your point,
but I'm afraid that I can't comply.</b>

06:12.010 --> 06:17.060
<b>It's no use. All violence
is strictly forbidden in this world.</b>

06:17.270 --> 06:19.850
<b>Well, my violence is no joke.</b>

06:20.650 --> 06:24.690
<b>It's futile.
You're wasting your time—</b>

06:25.110 --> 06:26.320
<b>What on earth...?</b>

06:27.780 --> 06:28.780
<b>Come on.</b>

06:34.660 --> 06:36.540
<b>Anos Voldigoad.</b>

06:39.040 --> 06:40.790
<b>- Is that you, Nigitt?
- Who's that?</b>

06:41.080 --> 06:43.630
<b>My subordinate from 2,000 years ago.</b>

06:43.630 --> 06:45.750
<b>He had supposedly vanished.</b>

06:45.750 --> 06:48.550
<b>I shall obey your command, and take...</b>

06:48.920 --> 06:49.930
<b>...that Source from you!</b>

06:55.510 --> 06:57.730
<b>Eges, how's Lena doing?</b>

06:57.730 --> 06:58.730
<b>She's safe.</b>

06:59.060 --> 07:02.150
<b>I've also rescued the others
from the Vanishment spell.</b>

07:02.150 --> 07:03.230
<b>But...</b>

07:03.440 --> 07:06.070
<b>Things have gotten complicated now.</b>

07:06.070 --> 07:10.740
<b>That Child of God seems to have seized
your subordinates from 2,000 years ago.</b>

07:10.740 --> 07:13.450
<b>Half of them are already
on their way to Delsgade.</b>

07:13.870 --> 07:15.740
<b>Let me take it from here.</b>

07:15.740 --> 07:18.660
<b>I won't destroy them out
of respect for your leniency.</b>

07:18.660 --> 07:23.420
<b>Hmm... after 2,000 years,
seems like you've mellowed, King of Curses.</b>

07:23.580 --> 07:27.000
<b>Like I said earlier,
I'm just leaving it to fate.</b>

07:27.000 --> 07:29.300
<b>We just happen to share
the same goal, that's all.</b>

07:32.470 --> 07:33.760
<b>You should go.</b>

07:41.480 --> 07:42.440
<b>Anos!</b>

07:42.440 --> 07:43.480
<b>I see that you're safe.</b>

07:43.690 --> 07:47.020
<b>Yes! That man with the eyepatch saved me.</b>

07:47.020 --> 07:48.900
<b>We're getting out of here, right?</b>

07:48.900 --> 07:50.820
<b>Yes. Do you know the way?</b>

07:51.900 --> 07:55.870
<b>I don't think that we can exit
the normal way right now.</b>

07:55.870 --> 07:57.120
<b>But...</b>

07:57.120 --> 07:58.120
<b>Tithi!</b>

07:58.120 --> 07:59.160
<b>Lena!</b>

07:59.160 --> 08:00.370
<b>It's Lena.</b>

08:00.370 --> 08:02.000
<b>Lena needs help.</b>

08:02.210 --> 08:05.080
<b>I want to get out of this place.
Do you think we can?</b>

08:05.080 --> 08:07.880
<b>We were told not to let
the Demon King or his friends out.</b>

08:08.090 --> 08:10.420
<b>Because Avos Dilhevia has awakened.</b>

08:10.420 --> 08:12.470
<b>We've got to protect Leno's child.</b>

08:12.630 --> 08:17.760
<b>Please. There's someone that
I have to see, no matter what.</b>

08:17.760 --> 08:18.560
<b>Please!</b>

08:23.100 --> 08:24.480
<b>Then, secretly, okay?</b>

08:24.480 --> 08:25.810
<b>We can do it if it's in secret.</b>

08:25.810 --> 08:27.110
<b>A secret from everyone!</b>

08:27.110 --> 08:27.820
<b>Okay!</b>

08:28.150 --> 08:30.230
<b>Here we go!</b>

08:38.990 --> 08:40.410
<b><i>Bye, Lena!</i></b>

08:40.410 --> 08:41.200
<b><i>See you!</i></b>

08:41.200 --> 08:42.750
<b><i>Let's meet again someday!</i></b>

08:44.080 --> 08:45.880
<b>What are we going to do now?</b>

08:45.880 --> 08:48.630
<b>We can get to the outside
of this barrier by using Direct Transfer.</b>

08:48.630 --> 08:50.710
<b>From there, we'll head to Delsgade.</b>

08:50.710 --> 08:52.050
<b>Um...</b>

08:52.260 --> 08:54.430
<b>Would you mind taking me, too?</b>

08:55.340 --> 08:57.600
<b><i>A Spirit with amnesia...</i></b>

08:57.890 --> 09:00.810
<b><i>This girl, whose ardent wish
is to see the Spirit King...</i></b>

09:00.930 --> 09:03.980
<b><i>There's no way that she's
not involved in this incident.</i></b>

09:03.980 --> 09:05.020
<b><i>Or perhaps...</i></b>

09:05.940 --> 09:10.110
<b>You have some unfinished business
from 2,000 years ago, too, don't you?</b>

09:10.110 --> 09:11.570
<b>I think so... probably.</b>

09:11.900 --> 09:14.360
<b>I see.
Then let us go together.</b>

09:14.820 --> 09:16.360
<b>Thanks!</b>

09:23.870 --> 09:25.370
<b>How should we go in?</b>

09:25.370 --> 09:27.250
<b>Force our way in, how else?</b>

09:27.540 --> 09:29.210
<b>Wait. Someone's coming out.</b>

09:36.510 --> 09:41.350
<b>The misfit and his subordinates are sure
to appear somewhere near these castle gates.</b>

09:42.680 --> 09:43.970
<b>Who's that?</b>

09:43.970 --> 09:45.350
<b>It's Elio Ludowell.</b>

09:46.310 --> 09:51.230
<b>A Royal who led the Midhaze forces
in the war between Azeshion and Dilhade.</b>

09:52.400 --> 09:54.150
<b>Split up and smoke out the enemy!</b>

09:54.150 --> 09:54.990
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

09:59.370 --> 10:01.990
<b><i>Your defense is quite lax, Elio.</i></b>

10:03.120 --> 10:06.500
<b>You might as well be inviting me to invade.</b>

10:06.500 --> 10:07.210
<b>Lord Elio!</b>

10:11.130 --> 10:15.420
<b>I see. So there are some who refuse
to accept Avos Dilhevia's rule.</b>

10:15.710 --> 10:21.600
<b>Yes. But except for us, most members
of our forces are now followers of Avos.</b>

10:22.390 --> 10:27.850
<b>Most likely, those who are unaware that you're
the true Demon King are the most vulnerable...</b>

10:28.270 --> 10:32.150
<b>So they just need to be convinced
that Avos Dilhevia is a fake?</b>

10:32.150 --> 10:35.230
<b>What about the Seven Elder Demon Emperors,
or your subordinates?</b>

10:35.230 --> 10:39.570
<b>The Demons from 2,000 years ago
are still serving the Demon King, according to lore.</b>

10:39.570 --> 10:41.910
<b>That must make Avos's authority
that much stronger.</b>

10:42.370 --> 10:44.120
<b>What's going on in the city?</b>

10:44.540 --> 10:46.700
<b>The city has been enveloped by Demera.</b>

10:47.200 --> 10:50.000
<b>That's a spell that implants
the will of Avos Dilhevia.</b>

10:50.000 --> 10:54.090
<b>And the Demon Royalty, who have proclaimed her
as the Demon King of Tyranny...</b>

10:54.300 --> 10:56.800
<b>...are particularly susceptible to this spell.</b>

10:57.590 --> 11:02.930
<b><i>My noble Royals. Kill those foolish hybrids...
Kill the Misfit!</i></b>

11:03.470 --> 11:05.560
<b>Just like the Asc of old?</b>

11:05.890 --> 11:10.350
<b>It also has the effect
of absorbing Magic Power from hybrid Demons.</b>

11:10.730 --> 11:14.190
<b>Already, some Royalists
in the city have gone berserk...</b>

11:14.730 --> 11:17.440
<b>...and it could soon escalate into a riot.</b>

11:27.410 --> 11:33.540
<b>Don't worry. We know better than anyone else
that Anos hasn't done anything wrong.</b>

11:33.540 --> 11:34.380
<b>Am I right?</b>

11:36.000 --> 11:36.840
<b>Mm-hmm.</b>

11:37.630 --> 11:39.510
<b>He'll come back home,
safe and sound.</b>

11:42.010 --> 11:43.300
<b>For sure!</b>

12:00.030 --> 12:03.450
<b><i>Why... is this happening to me?</i></b>

12:04.990 --> 12:08.660
<b><i>Using that dreadful magic...
to turn me into a hybrid...</i></b>

12:09.160 --> 12:11.500
<b><i>And who knows when I can be restored...</i></b>

12:17.670 --> 12:19.340
<b>There's nowhere for you to run now!</b>

12:20.670 --> 12:22.680
<b>Stop it! I'm a Royal!</b>

12:22.800 --> 12:23.720
<b>Huh?</b>

12:23.720 --> 12:25.680
<b>Are you out of your mind?</b>

12:25.680 --> 12:28.760
<b>Impersonating a Royal is an insult
to our founding ancestor.</b>

12:28.760 --> 12:29.640
<b>It's a grave offense!</b>

12:29.810 --> 12:31.850
<b>What, did you think you
could get away with it?</b>

12:32.060 --> 12:35.440
<b>You vulgar hybrid,
even the way you think is vulgar!</b>

12:35.860 --> 12:39.900
<b>That magic of yours—no matter how
you look at it, you're a hybrid!</b>

12:44.070 --> 12:45.700
<b><i>Absorbing my Magic Power?</i></b>

12:45.950 --> 12:51.120
<b>Be grateful. Your tainted Magic Power's going
to nourish the Royals, see?</b>

12:52.500 --> 12:53.710
<b>Take that!</b>

12:57.380 --> 13:00.960
<b>You hybrids are only still alive thanks
to the founding ancestor's mercy!</b>

13:01.260 --> 13:03.090
<b>Don't you dare stand up to the Royals!</b>

13:03.090 --> 13:04.510
<b>Submit to us!</b>

13:04.510 --> 13:07.220
<b>That's the life of a hybrid!</b>

13:08.970 --> 13:12.100
<b>Why... why are you doing this to me?</b>

13:12.100 --> 13:14.640
<b>Stop playing the victim card!</b>

13:14.640 --> 13:19.360
<b>It's because you're a lowlife
who wasn't born into Royalty, why else?</b>

13:19.610 --> 13:25.740
<b>Not being born into Royalty—
that's what's so utterly wrong about you all!</b>

13:25.740 --> 13:30.080
<b>You know full well that hybrids are below Royalty!</b>

13:30.490 --> 13:32.540
<b>Have you learned your lesson now?</b>

13:32.620 --> 13:35.620
<b>Such is the life of a hybrid.</b>

13:37.790 --> 13:42.050
<b>In the name of the true Demon King of Tyrany,
Avos Dilhevia—</b>

13:42.050 --> 13:44.510
<b>You will become nourishment
for the noble Royals.</b>

13:57.140 --> 13:58.600
<b>Stop it right now!</b>

13:59.020 --> 14:00.020
<b>Huh?</b>

14:02.480 --> 14:03.940
<b>Let that girl go!</b>

14:04.110 --> 14:05.490
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

14:05.490 --> 14:06.990
<b>Hold up a second, please.</b>

14:06.990 --> 14:09.780
<b>This lady is Anos's mother.</b>

14:10.450 --> 14:12.620
<b>Oh, yeah? Well, perfect!</b>

14:13.620 --> 14:16.370
<b>Let's make an example of her
to teach him a lesson!</b>

14:16.790 --> 14:18.710
<b>Hi-yah!</b>

14:19.290 --> 14:20.290
<b>Izabella! Now!</b>

14:20.580 --> 14:21.590
<b>Right!</b>

14:24.300 --> 14:25.010
<b>Are you all right?</b>

14:25.550 --> 14:28.010
<b>Let's go now.
It's not safe here!</b>

14:28.380 --> 14:30.510
<b>Why did you help me?</b>

14:31.550 --> 14:34.270
<b>I'm no longer... a Royal.</b>

14:34.720 --> 14:35.770
<b>And besides...</b>

14:35.980 --> 14:38.690
<b>Don't worry, I'm on your side.</b>

14:38.690 --> 14:42.150
<b>It's not right to kick someone
just because she's a hybrid.</b>

14:48.360 --> 14:50.950
<b>Hey, now, did you think
we'd let you get away?</b>

14:52.950 --> 14:54.290
<b>Izabella...</b>

14:54.580 --> 14:55.290
<b>Gusta!</b>

14:55.580 --> 14:59.040
<b>Why don't you sit tight and behave?
If you try anything...</b>

14:59.290 --> 15:01.250
<b>...you know what
the consequences will be, right?</b>

15:01.250 --> 15:02.420
<b>What will they be?</b>

15:02.420 --> 15:04.130
<b>Do I have to spell it out for you?</b>

15:04.130 --> 15:09.300
<b>I'm going to tear you limb from limb,
and send the pieces off to that misfit!</b>

15:12.550 --> 15:13.220
<b>Huh?</b>

15:13.890 --> 15:15.680
<b>A-Anos?</b>

15:15.890 --> 15:17.180
<b>I see.</b>

15:17.310 --> 15:19.270
<b>You want to be torn limb from limb?</b>

15:22.150 --> 15:24.320
<b>Hey! Listen, what are you doing?</b>

15:25.270 --> 15:28.860
<b>You think you're gonna get away with this?</b>

15:32.280 --> 15:34.370
<b>Don't tell me—no way!</b>

15:34.370 --> 15:35.530
<b>You're really gonna tear us—</b>

15:38.000 --> 15:41.080
<b>Don't worry, I'm not going
to tear you limb from limb.</b>

15:42.580 --> 15:45.000
<b>I'm going to dismember you
into hundreds of pieces.</b>

15:47.340 --> 15:50.050
<b>Avos Dilhevia is behind all of this.</b>

15:50.420 --> 15:54.550
<b>You can continue to just barely survive
in slices for the moment.</b>

15:56.430 --> 15:58.020
<b>Anos!</b>

15:58.020 --> 15:59.480
<b>I'm so glad you're all right!</b>

15:59.770 --> 16:02.900
<b>We believed in you.
That you'd come home, no matter what!</b>

16:03.270 --> 16:07.400
<b>Listen... to think that the Demon King
would be trying to kill you...</b>

16:07.400 --> 16:09.360
<b>it's some kind of mistake, right?</b>

16:09.610 --> 16:13.280
<b>Yes. Just a misunderstanding.
And it will be cleared up soon.</b>

16:13.490 --> 16:15.820
<b>Right. Of course it will, right?</b>

16:18.870 --> 16:21.040
<b>This house is a barrier that I created.</b>

16:21.500 --> 16:23.790
<b>Beyond even Avos Dilhevia's reach.</b>

16:23.790 --> 16:25.170
<b>Good to hear.</b>

16:28.090 --> 16:30.090
<b>Thank you for defending me.</b>

16:31.090 --> 16:33.630
<b>You can rest in the back if you'd like.</b>

16:33.630 --> 16:35.140
<b>No, but...</b>

16:35.850 --> 16:37.810
<b>You should make yourself at home.</b>

16:37.810 --> 16:40.720
<b>The chaos in town should settle down
in a few days.</b>

16:42.350 --> 16:45.230
<b>Don't be shy.
What's your name?</b>

16:45.860 --> 16:47.360
<b>It's... Emilia.</b>

16:47.360 --> 16:48.690
<b>Right! Emilia.</b>

16:50.070 --> 16:52.900
<b>All right, I have some delicious snacks!</b>

16:52.900 --> 16:53.820
<b>Okay.</b>

16:57.830 --> 17:02.160
<b>But listen, Anos,
you really brought home a ton of people.</b>

17:02.830 --> 17:07.500
<b>As your dad, there's nothing more
that I can teach you!</b>

17:10.090 --> 17:13.220
<b>Look at how lively your father is.</b>

17:13.220 --> 17:16.180
<b>Because I cast the Alto spell on him—</b>

17:16.180 --> 17:19.310
<b>the protective magic
that automatically heals the powerless.</b>

17:20.510 --> 17:23.180
<b>So that my father wouldn't overdo it.
Though I haven't told him about it.</b>

17:23.180 --> 17:24.980
<b>So he went outside without knowing?</b>

17:25.440 --> 17:28.110
<b>Just what we'd expect of your parents, Anos!</b>

17:28.520 --> 17:29.270
<b>Right.</b>

17:31.030 --> 17:34.740
<b>The question is, how are we going
to enter Delsgade?</b>

17:34.740 --> 17:36.320
<b>We can't go in from the gate.</b>

17:36.660 --> 17:40.700
<b>We're going to have to hold back, after all.
And they know it, so...</b>

17:41.120 --> 17:43.290
<b>...they're trying to exhaust Anos's Magic Power.</b>

17:43.620 --> 17:47.210
<b>They're also stalling for time so they
can steal the Magic Sword of Destruction.</b>

17:47.750 --> 17:52.630
<b>If she's also a Demon King of Tyranny,
why can't she steal it right away?</b>

17:52.960 --> 17:56.800
<b>Because there are no rumors or legends surrounding
the Magic Sword of Destruction.</b>

17:57.180 --> 18:01.890
<b>I rarely draw it, and everyone
who's seen it has perished. But still...</b>

18:02.350 --> 18:06.140
<b>There is a legend that Delsgade
is the Demon King of Tyranny's castle.</b>

18:06.770 --> 18:11.570
<b>She must be devising a way to obtain Venuzdnor
by using both Delsgade's and her own Magic Power.</b>

18:11.980 --> 18:17.660
<b>Which means that Avos Dilhevia can't avail herself
of any place not in the lore, then?</b>

18:17.950 --> 18:18.700
<b>Correct.</b>

18:18.700 --> 18:20.620
<b>Wait, does such a place exist?</b>

18:20.910 --> 18:24.450
<b>Oh, I know! The basement where Zeshia
and the others live!</b>

18:24.910 --> 18:28.870
<b>I added that part of Delsgade after
I was reincarnated.</b>

18:28.870 --> 18:30.210
<b>So it's beyond their reach.</b>

18:30.540 --> 18:33.500
<b>But doesn't Meleheyth know about it?</b>

18:33.500 --> 18:36.260
<b>I never told him about
the structure of the underground city.</b>

18:36.550 --> 18:39.430
<b>Since Zeshia and the others
are there, as well.</b>

18:40.010 --> 18:43.260
<b>You big girls are... very strong.</b>

18:43.260 --> 18:47.850
<b>That's right. If the enemy comes,
we'll drive them back before you can blink!</b>

18:48.270 --> 18:49.270
<b>Now, then...</b>

18:52.770 --> 18:54.690
<b>- Are we all going?
- No.</b>

18:55.280 --> 18:58.570
<b>I want you to stay here.
Take care of my parents, will you?</b>

18:58.570 --> 18:59.280
<b>Right!</b>

18:59.280 --> 19:00.570
<b>You can count on us!</b>

19:00.570 --> 19:01.990
<b>We'll protect them!</b>

19:01.990 --> 19:03.910
<b>The rest of us will head to Delsgade.</b>

19:04.370 --> 19:08.000
<b>Go down first.
Eleonore, I'm looking to you to guide them.</b>

19:08.000 --> 19:09.080
<b>Roger that!</b>

19:12.210 --> 19:14.300
<b>Unfortunately, time's running out.</b>

19:14.840 --> 19:17.550
<b>If there's something you want to say,
you need to say it now.</b>

19:21.090 --> 19:24.810
<b>You... you must be satisfied now, aren't you?</b>

19:25.100 --> 19:28.890
<b>Please kill me.
I want you to annihilate me!</b>

19:28.890 --> 19:31.020
<b>You're not going to ask me
to turn you back into a Royal?</b>

19:32.270 --> 19:33.900
<b>You can turn me back?</b>

19:33.900 --> 19:37.610
<b>Even if you did get turned back,
it wouldn't turn back time, you know.</b>

19:38.070 --> 19:44.620
<b>If we leave things as they are, Midhaze will soon
be ruled by the Demon Royalty, just as you wanted.</b>

19:45.870 --> 19:47.540
<b>Would you find that beautiful?</b>

19:48.830 --> 19:50.540
<b>What do you mean?</b>

19:50.790 --> 19:54.630
<b>Would you be able to live on,
thinking how beautiful it was in your eyes,</b>

19:54.630 --> 19:57.920
<b>if you were on the ruling side—
if you could just be a Royal?</b>

19:58.800 --> 20:01.340
<b>Now that you've spent some time as a hybrid,</b>

20:01.680 --> 20:06.100
<b>would you believe that you're noble,
if only your Royal status could be restored?</b>

20:08.430 --> 20:12.310
<b>If you can still feel that way,
I'll turn you back now.</b>

20:13.230 --> 20:15.610
<b>You should go to Avos Dilhevia.</b>

20:28.290 --> 20:29.330
<b>Emilia.</b>

20:30.500 --> 20:32.580
<b>You protected my mother, didn't you?</b>

20:35.250 --> 20:36.250
<b>Thanks.</b>

20:51.020 --> 20:54.480
<b>What on earth... am I supposed to do?</b>

21:12.160 --> 21:14.170
<b>There really is a whole city here.</b>

21:14.500 --> 21:17.460
<b>I'm so glad to see that you're
all having a good time!</b>

21:17.880 --> 21:19.800
<b>I feel like I've seen this somewhere before.</b>

21:19.800 --> 21:21.420
<b>Probably a book or something.</b>

21:21.840 --> 21:25.630
<b>I've recreated the townscape
from 2,000 years ago.</b>

21:25.630 --> 21:27.050
<b>A book...</b>

21:32.140 --> 21:33.100
<b>Open up.</b>

21:41.360 --> 21:42.070
<b>What's this?</b>

21:42.530 --> 21:45.700
<b>It leads to the underground dungeon
in the original Demon Castle.</b>

21:47.070 --> 21:51.410
<b>But I'm sure the enemy is also prepared
for me to show up from here.</b>

21:53.250 --> 21:54.410
<b>Are you ready?</b>

21:54.540 --> 21:55.580
<b>Mm-hmm.</b>

23:35.720 --> 23:39.980
<b>THE GREAT MOTHER SPIRIT
AND THE DEMON KING'S RIGHT-HAND MAN</b>

23:36.890 --> 23:40.020
<b>The Great Mother Spirit
and the Demon King's Right-Hand Man.</b>
